nd <strong> soon will be complete </strong>.<br></li><li> The music much better.<br></li><li> 50 levels with increasing complexity (Can you solve them all?).<br></li><li> Every month, between 10 and 15 new levels will be added<br></li><li> New achievements</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Looking for an exciting brain challenge? StartBolita is the perfect game for you! Inspired by Sokoban, this puzzle game will keep you glued to the screen as you strive to solve each level. Do you accept the challenge? Play StartBolita today!",
